{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40598,"sections":[{"id":"script-20598","name":"原始脚本 20598","scripts":[20598],"start":0,"count":36}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:1","scriptId":20598,"text":"和往常一样，空袭很快就过去了，整个警报大概就持续了十多分钟。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:2","scriptId":20598,"text":"这已经是死水的日常现象了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:3","scriptId":20598,"text":"“这次一共花了十八分钟，估计又是路过的飞行战车兽。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:4","scriptId":20598,"text":"波西娅一直望着墙上的钟，毕竟她们的研究室本来就在地下基本不用考虑避难问题。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:5","scriptId":20598,"text":"“这你都知道？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:6","scriptId":20598,"text":"“观察过好几次了，其实战车兽没有领空概念，想飞就飞才会被航空钢舞姬拦截。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:7","scriptId":20598,"text":"“目前最多的情况是它们看到钢舞姬会选择逃跑……所以空袭的总持续时长很短。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":735,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:8","scriptId":20598,"text":"“怎么听上去就像赶苍蝇……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:9","scriptId":20598,"text":"“没错，代价巨大的赶苍蝇工程，每次出击都是钱啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:10","scriptId":20598,"text":"“所以现在有RHO屋系统真的是帮大忙了，可以有效减少出击次数。只不过这东西是旅行者的‘专利’，没有柔的允许我们都不能拆解。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:11","scriptId":20598,"text":"“但是免费给我们提供防空技术给我们是不是会有猫腻？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:12","scriptId":20598,"text":"“就算有也是没办法的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:13","scriptId":20598,"text":"“而且这事情只有我们和团长等少数几个人知道，这个防空技术对外还是保密的，没有旅行者的允许禁止公开化。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:14","scriptId":20598,"text":"“按照兰布达的说法她和柔会不定期来检查并提取空防的数据，至于这些数据会用在哪里她们只字未提。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":735,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:15","scriptId":20598,"text":"“很神秘，但也无可奈何，有种寄人篱下的感觉？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:16","scriptId":20598,"text":"“是啊，RHO屋真的很有效，用久了绝对会上瘾。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:17","scriptId":20598,"text":"“如果她们没有恶意的话这绝对是个世纪大发明，而且说不定还能偷学到一些旅行者的技术~”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":734,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:18","scriptId":20598,"text":"“哼哼，后半句才是真心话吧~”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":734,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:19","scriptId":20598,"text":"“哪有那么容易，之前和兰布达相处那么久我也没学到什么。而且空钢核心也是在她的建议下才有了明显改良。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":734,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":730,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:20","scriptId":20598,"text":"“光这一点就让我们家族收获财富无数啊，再多搞搞我们怕是要成世界首富了啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":730,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:21","scriptId":20598,"text":"“说得轻巧，万一没出成果那可就是投资失败啊，这也是非常昂贵的代价。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":730,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:22","scriptId":20598,"text":"“不过就以姐姐的脑筋，好像从来都没失败过呢~”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:23","scriptId":20598,"text":"“你没见过不代表没有啊，我可是失败过无数次了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":735,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:24","scriptId":20598,"text":"“唉？已经失败那么多次了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:25","scriptId":20598,"text":"“你又不是没见过，我扔掉的废案早就堆起来了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:26","scriptId":20598,"text":"“那些废案可都是时间和心血，折算下来也是大笔开销。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":735,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:27","scriptId":20598,"text":"“唉，果然还是不太懂你们搞科研的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:28","scriptId":20598,"text":"“你只要管好自己就行了，本来以为你也会跟去特别空勤队呢，怎么？和长官闹变扭了？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":737,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:29","scriptId":20598,"text":"“哼，竟然瞒着我艾丽莎的身份，那家伙怎样都跟我无关了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":737,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:30","scriptId":20598,"text":"“哦，那件事啊，我觉得应该是有什么难言之隐吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":737,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:31","scriptId":20598,"text":"“不听不听不听！反正先不去想那个家伙的事情了，回到以前的生活也好。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:32","scriptId":20598,"text":"“算了，这种事情还是你们自己解决，如果你觉得这样就好的话，那我也不再过问了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:33","scriptId":20598,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:36","scriptId":20598,"text":"“之后的剧情正在施工中……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-054.webp","left":11,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:37","scriptId":20598,"text":"…………","background":"/art/stories/zjm-054.webp","left":11,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20598:20598:38","scriptId":20598,"text":"…………待续","background":"/art/stories/zjm-054.webp","left":11,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
